{"version":1,"key":"card:90","content":{"id":90,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"cd","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示 change directory，它的作用是用来切换工作目录的，它的基本使用如下"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"cd dir","language":"bash","uuid":"2a5e156c-2a16-4c95-8149-bfaf6368205b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"dir","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是一个路径，它可以是相对路径，也可以是绝对路径"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"# 切换到 /tmp 目录\n~ » cd /tmp\n/tmp » ls\nmath  tmpscfytyzt  tmux-1000\n# 切换到工作目录下的 math 目录\n/tmp » cd math\n/tmp/math » ls\nadd  add.c","language":"bash","uuid":"37efae59-1292-41d9-bf43-7f3174bfde71","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 Linux 中有几个特别的目录，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"~","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示用户的家目录，因此通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"cd ~","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以切换到家目录，或者直接使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"cd","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令，不指定任何的路径也可以直接切换到家目录。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"# 切换到家目录\ncd ~\n# 不指定任何路径，也表示切换到家目录\ncd","language":"bash","uuid":"8397b2d6-7da1-4c95-87db-16459d9f81f6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"还有两个特殊的目录，"},{"type":"formatted","text":".","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示当前目录，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"..","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示上一级目录，在每个目录中都有这两个特殊目录，这两个目录都是隐藏目录，可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"ls -a","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令查看隐藏文件"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"~ » ls -a\n.              .cache      .local           .sudo_as_admin_successful       hello\n..             .conda      .motd_shown      .viminfo                        hello.c\n.Xauthority    .condarc    .oh-my-zsh       .zcompdump                      math\n.bash_history  .config     .profile         .zcompdump-DESKTOP-PUSQM6M-5.8\n.bash_logout   .landscape  .python_history  .zsh_history\n.bashrc        .lesshst    .ssh             .zshrc","language":"bash","uuid":"29d7887a-3ca3-4845-a2b2-957e36f929d3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一般我们在进行移动，拷贝操作的情况下使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":".","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，将一些文件移动或拷贝到当前目录下；我们一般使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"cd ..","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来回到上级目录。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"cd","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令还有一个特殊的用法，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"cd -","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以回到上次所在的目录"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"# 当前目录为家目录\n~ » ls\nhello  hello.c  math\n# 切换到 /tmp 目录\n~ » cd /tmp\n# 回到上次所在的目录，也就是家目录\n/tmp » cd -\n~\n~ » ls\nhello  hello.c  math","language":"bash","uuid":"32904c18-8824-403c-abb8-ac88adf71d5c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["Linux/命令/cd"],"createTime":1689173895871,"updateTime":1755938573387,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1755938573387}}